That depends on the mahjong variation and scoring rules. Typically, the game ends when someone declares mahjong and has a completed hand of 14 tiles with four sets and a pair.
Mahjong is a very entertaining game that offers many challenges which explains that the game has been extremely popular all over the world for centuries. If you have never played mahjong and you like strategic and tactical games, then you should definitely give it a try.
