After fine grinded, Natural crystal diamond tool’s cutting edge can be very sharp, cutting edge radius can reach to 0.002μm, can achieve ultra-thin cutting, can be processed out of extremely high workpiece precision and very low surface roughness. It is recognized as an ideal ultra-precision machining tool.
