Open a phone line and find an internet service provider in France
You want to settle and work in France for a longer or shorter period. You will most likely need to open a phone line and find a suitable internet service provider.
When you want to settle in France for several months or years, it is often essential to open a telephone line, especially if you want to have access to the Internet. You should know that it is not essential to have an Internet access to open a phone line.
To open a phone line in France, you have to start with an eligibility test. This one allows to know the operators and the technologies to which the line is eligible.
Foreigners can open a phone line in France. Operators of fixed and mobile lines nevertheless expect a certain number of documents from these nationals wishing to open a telephone line in France.
To a company?
Finally, the price of the Internet offer is also an important criterion, especially when you come to France to study or look for a job. In this case, do not hesitate to compare the offers.
There are entry-level offers that only offer Internet access. They will be more advantageous for foreign residents arriving in France with few means (students, people looking for work).
Proof of address with a postal address located in metropolitan France: telephone operator's bill, tax notice, water, electricity or gas bill, residence tax notice ...
