Thus, thanks to this practical, intuitive and efficient service, you will not have to worry about parasitic and unused applications. You will only have to keep the ones that really serve you or even delete them all so you do not have to worry about them anymore.
In addition, MyPermissions serves as a watchdog tool to verify that new applications are not installed without your knowledge by inadvertently clicking on a link. A real relief in an internet riddled with traps to steal your data every moment.
Rest assured, MyPermissions does not allow itself to store your information and will only ask for the minimum permissions to delete the applications of your choice. In addition, if you want to keep no application on your networks, you can always delete it manually at any time!
