Each country has its own employment laws, and they all have their advantages and disadvantages depending on the situation. What are the assets of France?
An attractive country for young graduates
The thirty-five hours and the SMIC
Each month worked gives the right to two and a half days of paid leave, which corresponds to five weeks per year. It is an acquired right and all employees benefit from it.
